{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211110","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1321111001:1":{"text":"장인님, 실례합니다. 혹시 특별히 가고 싶은 곳이 있으신가요?","source_cn":"打扰一下，工匠先生。你有没有非常向往的地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x081D256707316A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321111002:1":{"text":"하, 만약 재료가 충분하고 최신 기계로 가득한 연구소가 있다면 매일 거기 틀어박혀서 멋진 물건을 만들어낼 텐데!","source_cn":"哈，要是有一个材料齐全、有各种最先进机械的研究所，我肯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x971E27617DAC240C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321111003:1":{"text":"왜? 시더 마을에서 우리 드워프들의 꿈을 이뤄주기 위해 기계 연구소라도 지어줄 생각인가?","source_cn":"怎么，雪松镇准备支持我们这群矮人的梦想，建一个机械研究所？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D7C527BFEC9BFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321111004:1":{"text":"아... 그건 아니고... 그냥 물어보는 것뿐이거든요.","source_cn":"啊……这倒不是，我只是随口问问。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91580581CAE3A0DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321111005:1":{"text":"뭐야, 갑자기 좋은 아이디어라도 생긴 줄 알았네. 좋다 말았잖아.","source_cn":"我还以为你们突然开窍了呢，真是白兴奋一场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E85407821E8C54D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321111006:1":{"text":"볼일 없으면 저리 가. 이 기계를 연구해야 한다고! 이게 없으면 일이 얼마나 지체될지 몰라!","source_cn":"没什么事就一边玩去吧，我还得研究这台机器。要是没了它，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB70230CE8801723F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321111007:1":{"text":"윽... 아무리 생각해 봐도 화이트마운틴의 가장 아름다운 풍경이 기계 연구소일 리 없죠...","source_cn":"呃……不管怎么想，白山公国的最美风景都不可能是机械研究...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5BE5C50E465D2C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321111008:1":{"text":"이번 답변은 도움이 안 되는 것 같네요. 다른 사람들에게 더 물어봐요!","source_cn":"看来这次获得的答案没什么帮助。我们再去问问其他人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDC6AF76752D39BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:娜塔莎":{"text":"나타샤","source":"娜塔莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:沉思的矮人工匠":{"text":"생각에 빠진 드워프 장인","source":"沉思的矮人工匠","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":4}}